  "name": "Shortbread - Mum's Recipe",
  "ingredients": "200g Plain Flour\n100g Corn flour\n100g Butter\n100g Margarine\n100g Caster Sugar\nPinch Salt",
  "directions": "Melt butter and margarine in pan. \n\nSift flour into bowl.\n\nAdd salt and sugar. \n\nPour melted fat into dry ingredients.\n\nSpread on greased tray.  Bake ¾ - 1 hour at a 175 degrees.\n\nCool slightly. \n\nDivide into fingers and sprinkle with Caster sugar.",
